    touchstone:summary "An LWS Server is an HTTP server that complies with all relevant MUST statements, specifically those in the Operations section." ;
    touchstone:clauseText """A LWS Server is an HTTP server [rfc9112] that complies with all of the relevant "MUST" statements in this specification. Specifically, the relevant normative "MUST" statements in 9. Operations of this document MUST be respected.""" ;
